<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios - Nov 8.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios - Nov 8.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Highest and lowest price earnings ratios for Australian companies included in the 320-company All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday. P/E based on rolling 12 months earnings.</p>
<p>Highest 10</p>
<p>Rank Name		    P/E    Close</p>
<p> 1   Portman Min	   365.08    2.30</p>
<p> 2   Niugini Min	   248.20    3.45</p>
<p> 3   Mayne Nickless	184.77    8.37</p>
<p> 4   T N T		   174.82    2.43</p>
<p> 5   Adel Bton Cement    121.74    1.68</p>
<p> 6   Colonial Coml	 119.13    2.18</p>
<p> 7   Herald Rsc	     97.35    1.10</p>
<p> 8   Westral Forest	 83.33    2.30</p>
<p> 9   Forrestania Gold     69.89    1.95</p>
<p>10   Energy Equity	  69.70    0.92</p>
<p>Lowest 10</p>
